  "prefLabel": "Ph 2206.02 Notification of Violations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2206.02 Notification of Violations. If, in the course of their investigation, a board investigator finds a violation of an administrative rule in plain sight, then the investigator shall issue a violation notice pursuant to the rules in Ph 2100.\n\nSource. #12997, eff 3-5-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
